+/*
+ *rtc 32k clock
+ *
+ *xtal--GATE------------------GATE---------------------|\
+ *	              |  --------                      | \
+ *	              |  |      |                      |  \
+ *	              ---| DUAL |----------------------|   |
+ *	                 |      |                      |   |____GATE__
+ *	                 --------                      |   |     rtc_32k_out
+ *	   PAD-----------------------------------------|  /
+ *	                                               | /
+ *	   DUAL function:                              |/
+ *	   bit 28 in RTC_BY_OSCIN_CTRL0 control the dual function.
+ *	   when bit 28 = 0
+ *	         f = 24M/N0
+ *	   when bit 28 = 1
+ *	         output N1 and N2 in run.
+ *	   T = (x*T1 + y*T2)/x+y
+ *	   f = (24M/(N0*M0 + N1*M1)) * (M0 + M1)
+ *	   f: the frequecy value (HZ)
+ *	       |      | |      |
+ *	       | Div1 |-| Cnt1 |
+ *	      /|______| |______|\
+ *	    -|  ______   ______  ---> Out
+ *	      \|      | |      |/
+ *	       | Div2 |-| Cnt2 |
+ *	       |______| |______|
+ **/
+
